OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity lifts ban on
OL,4,Acollarettes at Remembrance service
OL,5,
OL,6,FQueen's University Belfast (QUB) has
OL,7,Flifted a ban on collarettes being worn
OL,8,Fat its Remembrance Sunday service.
OL,10,FA document setting out arrangements for
OL,11,Fthe wreath-laying ceremony, seen by BBC
OL,12,FNews NI, stated: "Please note that
OL,13,Fcollarettes are not to be worn."
OL,15,FThe move was criticised by the
OL,16,Funiversity's Young Unionists club,
OL,17,Fwhich said that banning collarettes -
OL,18,Fsuch as those worn by Orange Order
OL,19,Fmembers - "reinforces the perception
OL,20,Famong some unionist students that
OL,21,FQueen's remains a cold house for their
OL,22,Fcommunity".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
