OL,3,GNEWSAUniversity lifts ban on
OL,4,Acollarettes at Remembrance service
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, QUB said that, "having
OL,7,Flistened to feedback" it had "agreed
OL,8,Fthat they can continue to be worn".
